<title>INDIA: No call money quotes because of RBI staff strike.</title>
<headline>No call money quotes because of RBI staff strike.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were no opening quotes for overnight call money rates on Monday because of a strike by staff of the Reserve Bank of India (RBI), dealers said.</p>
<p>The clerical staff of RBI in Bombay are striking on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are not quoting anything on the call money front&quot;, a primary dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
